// The curated catalog of known trophies (issue #342).
//
// Source: BBL's own authoritative trophy legend pages, `default.asp?p=tt`
// (team trophies) and `default.asp?p=ppr` (player trophies) -- confirmed
// exhaustive at 16 + 12 = 28 entries, matching every distinct `gfx/prizeN.gif`
// icon found anywhere in the mirrored BBL dataset. Descriptions are
// translated from the original Swedish. One further trophy (Ogretoberfest) is
// TP-only and has no BBL equivalent.
//
// Trophies deliberately carry NO shared "Name" external id, the same
// precedent competitions set in issue #285: superficially identical labels
// (e.g. "1st") can be genuinely different trophies depending on the
// competition tier, so identity is a curation decision, never inferred from
// label text. BBL's label text IS self-disambiguating, so each BBL trophy is
// keyed by the exact BBL label text itself (matching the raw source id/label
// convention every other curated-data file and every real BBL importer use --
// no prefix).
//
// TP is deliberately left unseeded: TP's raw `awardType` codes (1/2/3,
// 100/200) are not globally unique per trophy -- the same code means
// different things depending on which competition tier it appears in -- and
// resolving that needs a competition-classification concept that does not
// exist yet (issues #445 and #446). "Ogretoberfest" therefore carries no
// external id at all; the API matches it on its exact name instead, so
// re-running this import never duplicates it.
{
  externalSystems: [
    { name: 'tloeg.bbleague.se', category: 'imported_data_source' },
  ],
  trophies: [
    // ---------------------------------------------------------------
    // Team trophies
    // ---------------------------------------------------------------
    {
      name: 'Major 1st',
      recipientKind: 'team',
      description: 'Major season winner.',
      externalIds: [{ system: 'tloeg.bbleague.se', id: 'Major 1st' }],
    },
    {
      name: 'Major 2nd',
      recipientKind: 'team',
      description: 'Major season runner-up.',
